---
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';
interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const goalCodeUrl = 'https://github.com/princeton-nlp/WebShop/blob/master/web_agent_site/engine/goal.py';
const envCodeUrl = 'https://github.com/princeton-nlp/WebShop/blob/master/web_agent_site/envs/web_agent_text_env.py';
const readmeUrl = 'https://github.com/princeton-nlp/WebShop#webpage-environment-html-mode';
---

<section id="fig-webshop-goal-generation" class="canonical-figure webshop-goal-generation" aria-labelledby="webshop-goal-generation-title" data-ui-audit="contrast layout overflow">
  <header class="figure-header">
    <div class="figure-label">{t('第二步 · 商品生成购物任务','STEP 2 · PRODUCTS BECOME SHOPPING GOALS')}</div>
    <h2 id="webshop-goal-generation-title">{t('1,000 个商品，为什么最后会有 6,910 个 goals？','Why do 1,000 products become 6,910 goals?')}</h2>
    <p>{t('因为这里不是“一件商品 = 一道题”。WebShop 会把商品的文字要求、属性、价格条件和可选项组合成可执行的购物任务。','Because this is not “one product = one task.” WebShop turns product instructions, attributes, price constraints, and option combinations into executable shopping goals.')}</p>
  </header>

  <figure class="generation-story" aria-labelledby="webshop-goal-generation-title">
    <div class="macro-flow" aria-label={t('1,000 商品生成 6,910 goals','1,000 products generate 6,910 goals')}>
      <article class="macro-node products" data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>{t('SMALL WEBSHOP','SMALL WEBSHOP')}</small>
        <strong>1,000</strong>
        <span>{t('商品（products）','products')}</span>
      </article>

      <section class="generator" aria-label={t('WebShop 合成购物任务生成器','WebShop synthetic goal generator')}>
        <div class="generator-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="generator-card">
          <small>{t('WEBSHOP CODE','WEBSHOP CODE')}</small>
          <strong>{t('合成购物任务生成','Synthetic goal generation')}</strong>
          <code>get_synthetic_goals(...)</code>
          <span>{t('对商品的 option 组合使用 itertools.product(...)','Enumerates option combinations with itertools.product(...)')}</span>
          <a href={goalCodeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{t('查看官方 goal.py ↗','View official goal.py ↗')}</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <article class="macro-node goals" data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>{t('SMALL ENV OUTPUT','SMALL ENV OUTPUT')}</small>
        <strong>6,910</strong>
        <span>{t('购物 goals（购物任务）','shopping goals')}</span>
      </article>
    </div>

    <details class="one-product-example" open>
      <summary>
        <span>{t('点这里看懂关键原因','See the key reason')}</span>
        <strong>{t('一个商品，可以展开成多个 goal','One product can expand into multiple goals')}</strong>
      </summary>

      <div class="example-flow">
        <article class="product-record" data-ui-audit-item>
          <div class="example-label">{t('示意商品记录','SCHEMATIC PRODUCT RECORD')}</div>
          <strong>{t('一件有颜色和尺码选项的商品','A product with color and size options')}</strong>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>{t('基础要求','instruction_text')}</dt><dd>{t('找到符合要求的这类商品','Find this kind of product')}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>{t('颜色','Color')}</dt><dd><span>Black</span><span>Blue</span></dd></div>
            <div><dt>{t('尺码','Size')}</dt><dd><span>8</span><span>9</span><span>10</span></dd></div>
            <div><dt>{t('其他条件','Other conditions')}</dt><dd>{t('属性 + 价格上限','attributes + price limit')}</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p>{t('这是为了解释组合逻辑而画的示意例子，不是数据集中的某一条真实商品记录。','This is a schematic example of the combination logic, not a literal record from the dataset.')}</p>
        </article>

        <div class="combiner" aria-label={t('选项组合','Option combination')}>
          <code>Color × Size</code>
          <strong>2 × 3 = 6</strong>
          <span>{t('种 option 组合','option combinations')}</span>
        </div>

        <section class="goal-fan" aria-label={t('生成的示意 goals','Generated schematic goals')}>
          <div class="goal-card"><span>Goal 1</span><strong>Black · 8</strong></div>
          <div class="goal-card"><span>Goal 2</span><strong>Black · 9</strong></div>
          <div class="goal-card"><span>Goal 3</span><strong>Black · 10</strong></div>
          <div class="goal-card"><span>Goal 4</span><strong>Blue · 8</strong></div>
          <div class="goal-card"><span>Goal 5</span><strong>Blue · 9</strong></div>
          <div class="goal-card"><span>Goal 6</span><strong>Blue · 10</strong></div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </details>

    <aside class="meaning" role="note">
      <strong>{t('所以 1,000 → 6,910 表示什么？','So what does 1,000 → 6,910 mean?')}</strong>
      <p>{t('左边数的是商品；右边数的是由这些商品生成出来的可执行购物任务。它们不是同一种东西，也不是“一件商品只对应一道题”。','The left side counts products; the right side counts executable shopping goals generated from those products. They are different units, and one product can produce multiple goals.')}</p>
    </aside>

    <details class="evidence">
      <summary>{t('查看代码证据','Show code evidence')}</summary>
      <div class="evidence-grid">
        <article>
          <small>goal.py · RELEASED CODE</small>
          <code>combinations = list(itertools.product(...))</code>
          <p>{t('WebShop 会枚举一个商品不同 option 的组合，并为每一种组合构造 goal。','WebShop enumerates a product’s option combinations and constructs a goal for each combination.')}</p>
          <a href={goalCodeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{t('打开官方 goal.py ↗','Open official goal.py ↗')}</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <small>web_agent_text_env.py · RELEASED CODE</small>
          <code>human_goals=0 → get_goals(...)</code>
          <p>{t('默认 SimServer 使用 synthetic goals；随后固定 seed 233 打乱 goal 顺序。','The default SimServer uses synthetic goals, then shuffles goal order with fixed seed 233.')}</p>
          <a href={envCodeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{t('打开官方环境代码 ↗','Open official environment code ↗')}</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <small>WebShop README · OFFICIAL RUN OUTPUT</small>
          <code>Loaded 6910 goals.</code>
          <p>{t('官方 README 的 small WebShop 示例运行输出明确打印 6,910 goals。','The official README’s small-WebShop example run explicitly prints 6,910 loaded goals.')}</p>
          <a href={readmeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{t('打开官方 README ↗','Open official README ↗')}</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </details>

    <figcaption>{t('这一阶段只解释“商品 → goal”的生成关系。下一阶段再解释这些 6,910 goals 如何被 SEED 划成 held-out 与 train 两块。','This stage explains only the product → goal generation relationship. The next stage will show how SEED divides the 6,910 goals into held-out and train pools.')}</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<style>
  .webshop-goal-generation{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:2.2rem auto;padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)}
  .figure-header{max-width:900px}.figure-label{color:var(--accent);font:800 .66rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.figure-header h2{margin:.42rem 0 .65rem;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.7vw,2.9rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.045em}.figure-header p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
  .generation-story{margin:1.5rem 0 0}.macro-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(230px,.7fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;align-items:stretch}.macro-node{padding:1.1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface-muted);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-height:220px}.macro-node small{color:var(--muted);font:800 .6rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em}.macro-node strong{display:block;margin:.65rem 0 .12rem;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4.6rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.06em}.macro-node span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem}.macro-node.products{border-top:5px solid var(--line-strong,var(--line))}.macro-node.goals{border-top:5px solid var(--accent)}
  .generator{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}.generator-arrow{position:absolute;left:-.35rem;right:-.35rem;top:50%;height:2px;background:var(--accent)}.generator-arrow::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-2px;top:50%;border:7px solid transparent;border-left-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-50%)}.generator-card{position:relative;z-index:1;width:100%;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface);text-align:center}.generator-card small,.generator-card span{display:block}.generator-card small{color:var(--accent);font:800 .58rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.generator-card strong{display:block;margin:.28rem 0 .65rem;font-size:1rem}.generator-card code{display:block;padding:.5rem;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface-muted);font-size:.68rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.generator-card span{margin-top:.55rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.45}.generator-card a{display:inline-block;margin-top:.7rem;color:#1467d2;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .one-product-example{margin-top:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface)}.one-product-example summary{cursor:pointer;padding:1rem 1.1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:.45rem .8rem}.one-product-example summary span{color:var(--accent);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800}.one-product-example summary strong{font-size:.95rem}.example-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) 150px minmax(0,1.35fr);gap:1rem;padding:0 1rem 1rem;align-items:center}.product-record{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-muted)}.example-label{color:var(--muted);font:800 .58rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}.product-record>strong{display:block;margin:.4rem 0 .8rem;font-size:.9rem}.product-record dl{display:grid;gap:.45rem;margin:0}.product-record dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:95px 1fr;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.45rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.product-record dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.66rem}.product-record dd{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem;margin:0;font-size:.7rem}.product-record dd span{padding:.18rem .38rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface)}.product-record p{margin:.75rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.64rem;line-height:1.5}
  .combiner{text-align:center}.combiner code{display:block;color:var(--accent);font-weight:800}.combiner strong{display:block;margin:.25rem 0;font-size:1.5rem}.combiner span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.64rem}.goal-fan{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.45rem}.goal-card{padding:.65rem .7rem;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 38%,var(--line));border-radius:9px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 5%,var(--surface))}.goal-card span{display:block;color:var(--accent);font:800 .56rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.goal-card strong{display:block;margin-top:.2rem;font-size:.72rem}
  .meaning{margin-top:1rem;padding:.95rem 1.05rem;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 6%,var(--surface))}.meaning strong{font-size:.78rem}.meaning p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.55}
  .evidence{margin-top:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface)}.evidence summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.85rem 1rem;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem}.evidence-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.7rem;padding:0 1rem 1rem}.evidence-grid article{padding:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-muted)}.evidence-grid small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:800 .56rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.evidence-grid code{display:block;margin:.45rem 0;padding:.5rem;border-radius:6px;background:var(--surface);font-size:.66rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.evidence-grid p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.5}.evidence-grid a{display:inline-block;margin-top:.55rem;color:#1467d2;font-size:.66rem;font-weight:800}
  .generation-story figcaption{margin-top:.85rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.6}
  @media(max-width:860px){.macro-flow,.example-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.generator{min-height:155px}.generator-arrow{left:50%;right:auto;top:-.25rem;bottom:-.25rem;width:2px;height:auto;transform:translateX(-50%)}.generator-arrow::after{right:auto;left:50%;top:auto;bottom:-8px;transform:translateX(-50%);border:7px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--accent)}.combiner{padding:.45rem 0}.goal-fan{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.evidence-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.webshop-goal-generation{width:min(100% - 1rem,1120px);padding:1rem}.goal-fan{grid-template-columns:1fr}.product-record dl div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.one-product-example summary{display:block}.one-product-example summary strong{display:block;margin-top:.28rem}}
</style>
